---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Placeholder | DJ Phelix" description="Pre-launch privacy placeholder for djphelix.com.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-simple" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
    <div class="site-shell page-hero-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="section-number">Privacy</p>
        <h1 id="privacy-heading">A privacy policy is still to be finalized.</h1>
      </div>
      <p>This is an honest, minimal pre-launch placeholder. It must be updated with owner-approved privacy terms before an inquiry email or form endpoint begins collecting visitor information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section privacy-copy" aria-label="Privacy placeholder details">
    <div class="site-shell narrow-copy">
      <h2>What this placeholder means</h2>
      <p>DJ Phelix has not supplied final information about how inquiry details will be collected, used, stored, shared, retained, or deleted. The current static form is intentionally configured not to claim delivery.</p>
      <p>Before enabling a booking form or publishing a contact address, Phelix should replace this page with final policy language and a way for visitors to ask privacy questions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
